OL,3,GNEWSAGlasgow anti-social behaviour
OL,4,Adispersal zone extended until December
OL,5,
OL,6,FGlasgow's city centre dispersal zone is
OL,7,Fset to continue until December as part
OL,8,Fof a crackdown on crime and anti-social
OL,9,Fbehaviour.
OL,11,FPolice Scotland Chief Constable Jo
OL,12,FFarrell said more than 2,000 dispersal
OL,13,Fnotices had been issued since they were
OL,14,Fintroduced in March.
OL,16,FOfficers are able to ban groups of two
OL,17,For more people from the area for 24
OL,18,Fhours if their behaviour is "impacting
OL,19,Fon the safety and well-being" of
OL,20,Fothers.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
