OL,3,GNEWSAGlasgow anti-social behaviour
OL,4,Adispersal zone extended until December
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe area covered includes Union Street,
OL,7,FSt Enoch Square and the Four Corners,
OL,8,Fwhere there are concerns about drug
OL,9,Fdealing and other behaviour.
